wait 800
expect Lichess
expect Puzzles
tap How to play
expect Chess on Lichess
wait 250
clean
shot lichess-help
tap Play
expect Computer
clean
shot home
tap Computer
expect Your move
clean
shot computer-board
tap-id square-e2
expect e2 →
tap-id square-e4
expect-missing e2 →
wait-for Your move
clean
shot computer-replied
